<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Mudar de área virou o novo normal — San Educacional</mj-title>
    <mj-font
      name="Poppins"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap"
    />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Poppins, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" color="#050505" line-height="24px" />
      <mj-button
        background-color="#f84806"
        color="#ffffff"
        border-radius="999px"
        font-weight="700"
      />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#bb0185" width="602px">
    <mj-wrapper padding="0px">
      <!-- Header -->
      <mj-section background-color="#bb0185" padding="28px 0px 30px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image
            src="https://imghost.saneducacional.com.br/3ZOcg.png"
            alt="San Educacional"
            width="220px"
            align="center"
            padding="0px"
          />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Hero full-bleed -->
      <mj-section background-color="#bb0185" padding="0px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image
            src="https://imghost.saneducacional.com.br/MFEfl.jpg?w=1200"
            alt="Mudar de área virou o novo normal"
            fluid-on-mobile="true"
            padding="0px"
          />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Card branco headline -->
      <mj-section background-color="#fdfbf5" padding="16px 16px 0px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="0px">
            <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 22px; padding: 26px 22px">
              <div
                style="
                  font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                  font-weight: 700;
                  font-size: 16px;
                  line-height: 25px;
                  color: #050505;
                "
              >
                {$name|default('Estudante')}, mudar de área deixou de ser exceção, virou o novo normal.
              </div>
              <div
                style="
                  font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                  font-weight: 400;
                  font-size: 15px;
                  line-height: 24px;
                  color: #050505;
                  margin-top: 16px;
                "
              >
                O mercado hoje exige profissionais adaptáveis: capazes de fazer upskilling (evoluir na área atual) ou reskilling (aprender para uma nova função). E os números mostram isso:
              </div>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Stat 2-up -->
      <mj-section background-color="#fdfbf5" padding="16px 16px 0px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="0px">
            <table
              role="presentation"
              width="100%"
              cellpadding="0"
              cellspacing="0"
              style="border-collapse: collapse"
            >
              <tr>
                <td width="48%" valign="top" style="padding: 0 6px 0 0">
                  <div style="background-color: #bb0185; border-radius: 22px; padding: 22px 18px">
                    <div
                      style="
                        font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                        font-weight: 700;
                        font-size: 30px;
                        line-height: 32px;
                        color: #ffb765;
                        letter-spacing: -1.2px;
                      "
                    >
                      88%
                    </div>
                    <div
                      style="
                        font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                        font-weight: 600;
                        font-size: 13px;
                        line-height: 19px;
                        color: #fbe9f4;
                        margin-top: 10px;
                      "
                    >
                      das pessoas consideram vital seguir aprendendo ao longo da vida
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </td>
                <td width="48%" valign="top" style="padding: 0 0 0 6px">
                  <div style="background-color: #8d005e; border-radius: 22px; padding: 22px 18px">
                    <div
                      style="
                        font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                        font-weight: 700;
                        font-size: 30px;
                        line-height: 32px;
                        color: #ffb765;
                        letter-spacing: -1.2px;
                      "
                    >
                      72%
                    </div>
                    <div
                      style="
                        font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                        font-weight: 600;
                        font-size: 13px;
                        line-height: 19px;
                        color: #fbe9f4;
                        margin-top: 10px;
                      "
                    >
                      têm o objetivo de chegar ao topo da carreira, mesmo que o caminho mude de direção
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Box preto (Mês do Cliente) -->
      <mj-section background-color="#fdfbf5" padding="16px 16px 0px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="0px">
            <div style="background-color: #050505; border-radius: 22px; padding: 24px 22px">
              <table
                role="presentation"
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                style="border-collapse: collapse"
              >
                <tr>
                  <td width="54" valign="middle" style="padding: 0">
                    <div
                      style="
                        width: 54px;
                        height: 54px;
                        background-color: #3a3a3a;
                        border-radius: 999px;
                        text-align: center;
                        line-height: 54px;
                        font-size: 24px;
                      "
                    >
                      🎓
                    </div>
                  </td>
                  <td
                    valign="middle"
                    style="
                      padding-left: 14px;
                      font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                      font-weight: 600;
                      font-size: 15px;
                      line-height: 23px;
                      color: #ffffff;
                      text-align: left;
                    "
                  >
                    Para facilitar essa virada, a San lançou no
                    <span style="font-weight: 800">Mês do Cliente: ao fazer sua 2ª Graduação, a Pós-graduação sai grátis. </span
                    >A chance de dobrar sua qualificação sem dobrar o investimento.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Card branco centralizado + CTA -->
      <mj-section background-color="#fdfbf5" padding="16px 16px 0px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="0px">
            <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 22px; padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center">
              <div
                style="
                  font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                  font-weight: 400;
                  font-size: 15px;
                  line-height: 24px;
                  color: #050505;
                  text-align: center;
                "
              >
                A ideia de uma única profissão pra vida toda deu lugar ao acúmulo de experiências e essa condição existe justamente para facilitar essa mudança de rota. 😉
              </div>
              <a
                href="https://mailingredirect.saneducacional.com.br/redirect.php?codlead={$codlead}&amp;produto=10&amp;fornecedor=07&amp;nome_produto=Graduação&amp;curso=000&amp;nome_curso=Graduação"
                style="
                  display: block;
                  background-color: #f84806;
                  color: #ffffff;
                  font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                  font-weight: 700;
                  font-size: 15px;
                  line-height: 20px;
                  text-align: center;
                  text-decoration: none;
                  border-radius: 999px;
                  padding: 16px 20px;
                  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #b02f00;
                  margin-top: 22px;
                "
              >
                Quero conhecer os cursos
              </a>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Card vagas -->
      <mj-section background-color="#fdfbf5" padding="16px 16px 16px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="0px">
            <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 22px; padding: 26px 22px">
              <table
                role="presentation"
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                style="border-collapse: collapse"
              >
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #050505">
                    🔥 Vagas preenchidas
                  </td>
                  <td
                    align="right"
                    style="
                      font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                      font-weight: 700;
                      font-size: 22px;
                      color: #f84806;
                      letter-spacing: -0.66px;
                    "
                  >
                    10%
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <div style="height: 10px; background-color: #f4e3ee; border-radius: 999px; margin-top: 18px">
                <div style="height: 10px; width: 10%; background-color: #f84806; border-radius: 999px"></div>
              </div>
              <div
                style="
                  font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                  font-weight: 400;
                  font-size: 13px;
                  line-height: 20px;
                  color: #5b4a55;
                  margin-top: 14px;
                "
              >
                🔥 10% das vagas já foram preenchidas
              </div>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <mj-section background-color="#8d005e" padding="24px 22px 34px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text align="center" padding="0px">
            <div
              style="
                font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 19px;
                color: #f0d0e7;
                text-align: center;
              "
            >
              0800 145 2300 ·
            </div>
            <div
              style="
                font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 19px;
                color: #f0d0e7;
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 4px;
              "
            >
              @saneducacional
            </div>
          </mj-text>
          <mj-divider border-color="#ad4589" border-width="1px" padding="18px 0px" />
          <mj-text align="center" padding="0px">
            <div style="font-family: Poppins, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 19px; text-align: center">
              <a href="{$unsubscribe}" style="color: #f0d0e7; text-decoration: underline">Descadastre-se</a>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
